{1}{[Before you sits an elf, his legs crossed, his head down. An air of weariness surrounds him. He notices your presence, and slowly, purposefully, stands and addresses you.] Yes, what is it?}{[Before you sits an elf, his legs crossed, his head down. An air of weariness surrounds him. He notices your presence, and slowly, purposefully, stands and addresses you.] Yes, what is it?}{}{1}{}{ss21 }
