{45}{Interesting. And just what is it that you are going to stop me from doing? I have so many things on my social calendar these days, it is difficult to know which you are making reference to, in particular.}{Interesting. And just what is it that you are going to stop me from doing? I have so many things on my social calendar these days, it is difficult to know which you are making reference to, in particular.}{}{5}{}{ }
{46}{I will not permit you to escape the Void and return to Arcanum.}{}{5}{}{55}{ }
{47}{I forgot. Uhm... Oh! You no go back to Arcanum!}{}{-4}{}{55}{ }
{55}{You will not permit me? How droll! You really have absolutely no idea of what you are involved with here, do you?}{You will not permit me? How droll! You really have absolutely no idea of what you are involved with here, do you?}{}{6}{}{ }
{56}{To be honest, I've become involved in events beyond my control.}{}{5}{}{75}{ }
{57}{It is my destiny to bring an end to your evil tyranny!}{}{5}{lf2 0}{65}{ }
{58}{Uh. No? Why you try to kill me?}{}{-4}{}{720}{ }
{59}{Come out of pretty color and I kill you now.}{}{-4}{}{125}{ }
{60}{It doesn't matter. I'm here to stop you, it is as simple as that.}{}{5}{}{815}{ }
{65}{[His boisterous laughter seems to shake the very walls.] My tyranny? That is rich! Hilarious! I have not had this much entertainment for hundreds of years!}{[His boisterous laughter seems to shake the very walls.] My tyranny? That is rich! Hilarious! I have not had this much entertainment for hundreds of years!}{}{7}{}{ }
{66}{You're mocking me. It will not keep me from killing you, however.}{}{5}{}{15}{ }
{75}{That is a feeling I have much familiarity with. Sometimes I feel that my fate was decreed from an early age.}{That is a feeling I have much familiarity with. Sometimes I feel that my fate was decreed from an early age.}{}{8}{}{ }
{76}{You are here because of your actions, not some cruel twist of fate.}{}{5}{}{85}{ }
{85}{Do not misunderstand me, I take full responsibility for my actions. [He pauses, dramatically.] Though how are one's actions determined, really? How is our view of the world shaped? Mine was shaped by arguably the most powerful individual in the world, my father. He raised me on tales of the righteous superiority of the elves and the destiny that brought us to rule over all the races.}{Do not misunderstand me, I take full responsibility for my actions. [He pauses, dramatically.] Though how are one's actions determined, really? How is our view of the world shaped? Mine was shaped by arguably the most powerful individual in the world, my father. He raised me on tales of the righteous superiority of the elves and the destiny that brought us to rule over all the races.}{}{9}{}{ }
{86}{I don't think it was Nasrudin's intent that you destroy a whole city.}{}{5}{}{95}{ }
{87}{Oh, by the way, about your father. I killed him.}{}{5}{gf2061 1}{320}{ }
{88}{Are you aware your father died as a result of your battle?}{}{5}{na-500}{375}{al -25 }
{95}{What did he expect? He shoved a young, immature, inexperienced fool into a position of immense power and set me loose on the world. Why didn't he stop me...he should have stopped me...}{What did he expect? He shoved a young, immature, inexperienced fool into a position of immense power and set me loose on the world. Why didn't he stop me...he should have stopped me...}{}{10}{}{ }
{96}{Wait, are you trying to tell me you feel guilt over what you did?}{}{5}{}{105}{ }
{105}{Most certainly. I have had two thousand years of my grievous errors in judgment replaying themselves in my mind. One tends to grow a bit of a conscience in all that time.}{Most certainly. I have had two thousand years of my grievous errors in judgment replaying themselves in my mind. One tends to grow a bit of a conscience in all that time.}{}{11}{}{ }
{106}{Hmmm.  That's interesting...}{}{5}{pa 6613, lf6 0}{-57}{lf6 1 }
{107}{Hmmm.  That's interesting...}{}{5}{lf5 0, pa 6613, lf6 0}{-57}{lf5 1, lf6 1 }
{108}{You'll excuse me if I don't believe you're overcome with guilt.}{}{5}{pa -6613, lf6 0}{115}{lf6 1 }
{109}{Where was your new conscience when you threatened my life?}{}{5}{lf5 0, pa -6613, lf6 0}{165}{lf5 1, lf6 1 }
{110}{You'll excuse me if I don't believe you're overcome with guilt.}{}{5}{lf5 0, lf6 1}{115}{lf5 1 }
{111}{Where was your new conscience when you threatened my life?}{}{5}{lf6 1}{165}{ }
{112}{An interesting vision, child.  Let us hope you are as clairvoyant as you are outspoken.  [Them, turning to you.]  Now, my friend.  As I was saying.  I've had more than a little time to see the error of my ways.  Two millennia in isolation tend to make one introspective, to say the least...}{An interesting vision, child.  Let us hope you are as clairvoyant as you are outspoken.  [Them, turning to you.]  Now, my friend.  As I was saying.  I've had more than a little time to see the error of my ways.  Two millennia in isolation tend to make one introspective, to say the least...}{}{12}{}{ }
{113}{Forgive me if I don't necessarily believe this change of heart...}{}{5}{}{115}{ }
{114}{That's quite a turn around from the day that you killed me...}{}{5}{lf5 0}{165}{lf5 1 }
{115}{What you do or do not believe is of no concern to me, my friend.}{What you do or do not believe is of no concern to me, my friend.}{}{13}{}{ }
{116}{Come out of your shell and we'll settle this right now, "friend".}{}{5}{}{125}{ }
{117}{If you are so regretful, why are you trying to return for revenge?}{}{5}{}{175}{ }
{125}{[His laughter fills the great hall.] You fool! You think this is my protection? This is my prison! I've been trapped inside this shell for nearly two thousand years!}{[His laughter fills the great hall.] You fool! You think this is my protection? This is my prison! I've been trapped inside this shell for nearly two thousand years!}{}{14}{}{lf7 1 }
{126}{What? That's impossible! This must be some sort of trick.}{}{5}{}{823}{ }
{127}{You foolin. You try trick me cuz I not smart.}{}{-4}{}{823}{ }
{135}{This is Kerghan's doing. When I first came here and realized what he was becoming, I attempted to stop him. Our battle was intense, yet brief. As you can see, I was not the victor.}{This is Kerghan's doing. When I first came here and realized what he was becoming, I attempted to stop him. Our battle was intense, yet brief. As you can see, I was not the victor.}{}{15}{}{lf4 1, ru2119 }
{136}{Why didn't he kill you?}{}{5}{}{145}{ }
