{159}{Do you regret having him banished?}{}{5}{}{400}{ }
{165}{I did no such thing. I have been here for ages. Do you really think I could reach across the Void to torment you?}{I did no such thing. I have been here for ages. Do you really think I could reach across the Void to torment you?}{}{18}{}{ }
{166}{I tire of your lies. Come out of your shell and fight me.}{}{5}{}{125}{ }
