{300}{I am not saying it will be easy to defeat Kerghan. In fact, the attempt might be fatal. Yet I believe it worth the risk. We cannot let him return to Arcanum, it would mean the end of all life there. I have a few...acquaintances on this side that may be interested in helping us as well, should you succeed in releasing me.}{I am not saying it will be easy to defeat Kerghan. In fact, the attempt might be fatal. Yet I believe it worth the risk. We cannot let him return to Arcanum, it would mean the end of all life there. I have a few...acquaintances on this side that may be interested in helping us as well, should you succeed in releasing me.}{}{32}{}{ }
{302}{I have the Vendigroth Device.}{}{5}{in5616}{310}{ }
