{304}{I will release you so that you may join me. [Lie]}{}{5}{}{270}{gf2044 1 }
{309}{I'm not interested in suicide missions. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{310}{Then our task should be at least a fraction easier. All we need to do is hurt him enough so that he attempts to regenerate himself, and then you can use the Device on him. Of course, this is easier spoken of than accomplished.}{Then our task should be at least a fraction easier. All we need to do is hurt him enough so that he attempts to regenerate himself, and then you can use the Device on him. Of course, this is easier spoken of than accomplished.}{}{33}{}{ }
{311}{I will release you so that you may join me. [Truth]}{}{5}{}{270}{gf2045 1, qu1057 2 }
