{320}{[He looks at you, shocked. After a moment, his countenance softens.] You almost had me for a minute, there. Time passes differently here, it is easy to forget that over two thousand years have passed in Arcanum. My father has to have died at least a thousand years before you were even born.}{[He looks at you, shocked. After a moment, his countenance softens.] You almost had me for a minute, there. Time passes differently here, it is easy to forget that over two thousand years have passed in Arcanum. My father has to have died at least a thousand years before you were even born.}{}{34}{}{ }
{321}{He found a way to regenerate himself for a thousand years.}{}{5}{gf2063 1}{330}{ }
{322}{I don't know how he was still alive, but I corrected that.}{}{5}{gf2063 0}{330}{ }
{323}{Why would you care? I simply finished what you had started.}{}{5}{}{360}{ }
{330}{[The shock of your words drains the blood from his face.] He was still alive? And you killed him?! [His screams are deafening.] You bastard! I will flay your skin from your bones and leave you to the vultures! [He violently throws himself against the walls of his shell, and you realize he is trapped within it.] Kerghan sent you here to torture me!}{[The shock of your words drains the blood from his face.] He was still alive? And you killed him?! [His screams are deafening.] You bastard! I will flay your skin from your bones and leave you to the vultures! [He violently throws himself against the walls of his shell, and you realize he is trapped within it.] Kerghan sent you here to torture me!}{}{35}{}{ }
{331}{Kerghan trapped you in there?}{}{5}{}{340}{ }
{340}{[His words come rushed, breathless. He has exhausted himself in his attempts to break the shell in his attempt to throttle the life from you.] You tell Kerghan he's dead. You're dead, @pcname@.}{[His words come rushed, breathless. He has exhausted himself in his attempts to break the shell in his attempt to throttle the life from you.] You tell Kerghan he's dead. You're dead, @pcname@.}{}{36}{}{gf2067 1 }
{341}{When did Kerghan trap you? After you had the BMC banished?}{}{5}{}{350}{ }
{350}{[He turns his back to you. It is obvious he will not speak to you again.]}{[He turns his back to you. It is obvious he will not speak to you again.]}{}{37}{}{ }
{351}{I suppose I am off to find Kerghan, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{360}{You do not know! You weren't there! We were locked in an ideological struggle bigger than either of us! I was attempting to save the world from the evils of technology and my father couldn't see past his righteous ideals. [He casts his eyes downward.] And neither could I...}{You do not know! You weren't there! We were locked in an ideological struggle bigger than either of us! I was attempting to save the world from the evils of technology and my father couldn't see past his righteous ideals. [He casts his eyes downward.] And neither could I...}{}{38}{}{ }
{361}{I killed him, and I'll kill you to. Come out of your shell.}{}{5}{}{380}{ }
{362}{He begged for his life like a frightened child before I killed him.}{}{5}{}{330}{ }
{370}{[He makes an extravagant gesture of mock outrage.] What? Without even a polite introduction? What has happened to common courtesy?}{[He makes an extravagant gesture of mock outrage.] What? Without even a polite introduction? What has happened to common courtesy?}{}{39}{}{ }
{371}{I am @pcname@, and I am here to kill you.}{}{5}{}{15}{ }
{375}{I had feared the worst. As I was being drawn into this realm, I looked into his face for the last time. His gaze was filled with pain, and I fear most of it was not physical. I will never forget that look as long as I live.}{I had feared the worst. As I was being drawn into this realm, I looked into his face for the last time. His gaze was filled with pain, and I fear most of it was not physical. I will never forget that look as long as I live.}{}{40}{}{ }
{376}{His disappointment in you was understandable, don't you think?}{}{5}{}{95}{ }
{377}{Don't tell me you're feeling guilty over your actions?}{}{5}{}{105}{ }
{378}{I was jesting, in all actuality. I killed him myself.}{}{5}{gf2061 1}{320}{ }
{380}{[His laughter fills the great hall.] You fool! You think this is my protection? This is my prison! I've been trapped inside this shell for nearly two thousand years! If I were able to extricate myself from this entrapment you would already be dead.}{[His laughter fills the great hall.] You fool! You think this is my protection? This is my prison! I've been trapped inside this shell for nearly two thousand years! If I were able to extricate myself from this entrapment you would already be dead.}{}{41}{}{ }
{381}{I would squish you like I did your pathetic father.}{}{5}{}{330}{ }
